    "field": "Phylogeography",
    "problem": "Detecting the genetic impacts of recent habitat fragmentation is difficult because these effects are often confounded by stronger, pre-existing genetic signatures caused by historical demographic events like climate-driven bottlenecks and range shifts.",
    "method": "To assess the effects of demographic history on genetic diversity in *Dipteryx alata*, this study couples coalescence analyses of microsatellite data with ecological niche modeling to hindcast the species' distribution and evaluate how historical population changes have shaped current genetic patterns.",
    "task": "The task is to assess the effects of demographic history on the genetic diversity and population structure of the Neotropical tree *Dipteryx alata* using coalescence analyses and ecological niche modeling to hindcast its distribution over the last 21,000 years.",
