    "innovation": "This paper integrates genetic analyses with ecological niche modeling to demonstrate that the low genetic diversity in the Neotropical tree *Dipteryx alata* is a consequence of historical range shifts during the late Pleistocene, rather than recent habitat fragmentation.",
